{
  "id": "T-STANDINTILL",
  "title": "H-STANDINTILL-1: a FRESH stand-in takes the absent owner's till over from the hand-over bundle (MergerAbsence.TakeOverTill -> PaperworkSync.FillTill), so its stale copies are never paid, the owner's pre-absence unpaid orders ride through the stint, and each order is paid exactly once across the machines (DEV lever tillledger: synthetic tagged orders T<tag>#<k>, per-order PAID ledger lines). H-STANDINTILL-2 leg 'hand-back flush': T5 orders taken <30 s before the owner returns reach the owner exactly once through the stand-in's hand-back publish. NO save. R2 leg T6 'leave publish': orders taken <30 s before the owner leaves ON PURPOSE (DEV leavegame menu) reach the host through the leave publish and are paid exactly once. D1 leg T7 'leavegame disc' (review of 147e031, 2026-09-28): orders taken <30 s before the owner leaves through the mod's Disconnect button reach the host through the leave publish - the client's close waits until its transport reports nothing pending (2 s ceiling) and lingers - and are paid exactly once.",
  "preconditions": "Fixture fx-hq1 (merged pair melaus + Client1, keepMerger); Client1 owns the fast food at vars.shop. Client2 joins new and is grown into the company (as t-standinput). The member host is the stand-in. Dev build with tillledger / absence / regstate / mergestatus / exitbuilding. Tags: T1 = A's pre-absence unpaid orders, T2 = B's stale copies, T3 = B's stint orders paid at B's roll, T4 = stint orders still unpaid at A's return. T5 = stint orders taken after a forced publish, carried only by the hand-back publish. T6 = A's orders taken right before it leaves on purpose (leavegame menu), carried only by the leave publish.",
  "instances": 3,
  "vars": {
    "clientPid": "Client1",
    "hostPid": "melaus",
    "dPid": "Client2",
    "session": "fx-hq1",
    "keepMerger": true,
    "shop": "11 ba:street_tenthavenue"
  },
  "oracles_absent": [
    "HarmonyException",
    "Patching exception",
    "(?<!swallowed )NullReferenceException",
    "\\[TillLedger\\] \\S+ PAID T2#",
    "\\[Absence\\] till take-over '",
    "\\[TillLedger\\] \\S+ PAID T[1-4]#.* books=False",
    "\\[TillLedger\\] \\S+ PAID T6#.* books=False"
  ],
  "oracles_report": [
    "\\[TillLedger\\]",
    "\\[Absence\\] till of ",
    "\\[Paperwork\\] returned books",
    "\\[Absence\\] simulating",
    "\\[Absence\\] stopped simulating",
    "\\[Paperwork\\] kept the simulated record",
    "\\[Absence\\] hand-back publish",
    "\\[Paperwork\\] filed",
    "\\[Paperwork\\] leave publish"
  ],
